 you became, by His favor, brothers. And you were on the edge of a pit of the Fire, and He saved you from it. Thus does Allāh make clear to you His verses that you may be guided.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":103,"sd":null},{"k":"3:104","t":"And let there be [arising] from you a nation inviting to [all that is] good, enjoining what is right and forbidding what is wrong, and those will be the successful.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":104,"sd":null},{"k":"3:105","t":"And do not be like the ones who became divided and differed after the clear proofs had come to them. And those will have a great punishment","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":105,"sd":null},{"k":"3:106","t":"On the Day [some] faces will turn white and [some] faces will turn black. As for those whose faces turn black, [to them it will be said], \"Did you disbelieve [i.e., reject faith] after your belief? Then taste the punishment for what you used to reject.\"","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":106,"sd":null},{"k":"3:107","t":"But as for those whose faces turn white, [they will be] within the mercy of Allāh. They will abide therein eternally.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":107,"sd":null},{"k":"3:108","t":"These are the verses of Allāh. We recite them to you, [O Muḥammad], in truth; and Allāh wants no injustice to the worlds [i.e., His creatures].","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":108,"sd":null}],"juz":4,"hizb":7,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}